<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μογοσ-τόκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		goddess <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of birth-pangs</i>,
			epith. of Eileithyiai (or -yia), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.270
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.187
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.103
			</span></i>; of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				27.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὠδῖνες</span>
			<i>hard travail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				829
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>suffering hard travail</i>, metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος</span>, of the Wooden Horse, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				386
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bringing the pangs of travail</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					41.133
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσθμα κεραυνοῦ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
